index 17d3bbd..27928ee 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -1,6 +1,15 @@
 Version history
 ===============
 
+**UNRELEASED**
+
+- Added support for SQLAlchemy 2.x and dropped support for SQLAlchemy 1.4 (minimum
+  required version is now 2.0)
+- Python type annotations for columns whose Python type is not a builtin (e.g. UUID
+  columns) are now rendered using the fully qualified name (e.g. ``uuid.UUID``) in
+  order to avoid clashing with the SQLAlchemy type names imported in the generated
+  module
+
 **3.0.0rc2**
 
 - Added support for generating SQLModel classes (PR by Andrii Khirilov)
